T4.
USER,GUEST,GUEST.
$NORERUN.
$SETTL,7777.
$COMPASS.
$LOAD,LGO.
$EXECUTE.
***
*** T4 COMPLETE
***
EXIT.
$DAYFILE.
***
*** T4 FAILED
***
~eor
          IDENT  TEST
          ENTRY  TEST
          SYSCOM B1
TEST      BSS    0
          SA1    =10HHELLO KRON
          MESSAGE MSG,0
          ENDRUN
MSG       DATA   C*HELLO FROM COMPASS*
          END    TEST
